{
  "slug": "daytona",
  "name": "Daytona",
  "type": "plugin",
  "description": "An agent skill for creating and running sandboxes on the Daytona platform.",
  "longDescription": "Ships **1 skill**, `daytona` (Creates and manages isolated cloud sandboxes (secure code execution environments with dedicated runtimes) on the Daytona platform).\n\nInstalls with `claude plugin install daytona@claude-community` from `daytona/skills`.\n\nAn agent skill for creating and running sandboxes on the Daytona platform. Includes references and practical patterns for the Daytona API, CLI, Python, TypeScript, Java, Go, and Ruby SDKs.",
